WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.880
You may have heard that earlier this year Ben Affleck sold his AI filmmaking company to Netflix for like

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:07.760
500 million dollars. What does it do?

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:12.800
It's not about text prompting or generating something from nothing. You're building a model from your own material.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:17.680
You have to create your movie essentially first before you can really build your model around your movie using AI.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:23.920
Okay, so instead of making things by ripping off other people, you make things ripping off your own people.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:28.640
Not sure this solves the ethics problem, but at least it's gonna look way better, right?

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:50.060
I'm telling you, bro, imagine working at Netflix, getting denied a raise, and then watching this movie.

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:58.100
This game-changing technology has managed to look worse than that movie from the 80s that Paul Rudd is always making fun of.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:00.660
Woo!
